						 <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sekai-s" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4476849&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609945050" alt="Sekai_s" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4476849)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sekai-s" >Sekai_s</a></span></p> 
